page ViewsPage
  Section id:"views-file-model" py:{ xs:6 md:10 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:3
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "VIEWS / FILE MODEL"
        Title size:{ xs:"3xl" md:"6xl" } weight:"black"
          "Four declarations, one routed screen"
        Text size:"lg" color:"muted"
          "main.dowe activates a views graph. The graph maps paths to layouts and pages. Layouts provide the shared shell, pages provide route content, and components reuse static view trees."
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:2 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"primary"
              "views"
            Title size:"xl" weight:"black"
              "Maps paths to screens"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "A views declaration imports layouts and pages, then connects them with group and route entries. It describes navigation; it does not contain the screen UI."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "layout"
            Title size:"xl" weight:"black"
              "Owns the shared shell"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "A layout wraps routed pages with persistent UI such as an AppBar, Sidebar, Footer, or navigation. It has one normal visual root and inserts page content through children."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "page"
            Title size:"xl" weight:"black"
              "Owns one route's content"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "A page is the content selected by a route. It starts with Section, may use ordered sibling Sections, and cannot use the layout children boundary."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "component"
            Title size:"xl" weight:"black"
              "Reuses a static view tree"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "A component extracts UI repeated by layouts, pages, or other components. The current contract does not accept props, slots, child content, Signals, functions, or requests."
  Section id:"views-project-shape" p:{ xs:5 md:7 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "PROJECT SHAPE"
        Title size:{ xs:"2xl" md:"4xl" } weight:"black"
          "Organize by responsibility"
        Text color:"muted"
          "This structure is recommended because it makes ownership obvious. Only main.dowe and theme.dowe have fixed locations; imported modules are classified by their declarations, not by their folders."
      Code:
        language:"dowe"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"surface"
        copyLabel:"Copy view project structure"
        copiedLabel:"Copied"
        content:"""
          main.dowe
          theme.dowe
          views/
            routes/
              app-routes.dowe
            layouts/
              app-layout.dowe
            pages/
              home-page.dowe
              about-page.dowe
            components/
              app-brand.dowe
            store/
            types/
        """
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:3 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Fixed root files"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "main.dowe connects the application. theme.dowe defines project design defaults. Neither file is imported as an ordinary module."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Recommended folders"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "routes, layouts, pages, and components are conventions for humans and agents. Moving a module is valid when its imports are updated."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Reachable modules"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Dowe compiles the static import graph starting at main.dowe. An unimported file does not become part of the application because it sits inside views."
  Section id:"views-connected-example" py:{ xs:7 md:10 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "CONNECTED EXAMPLE"
        Title size:{ xs:"2xl" md:"4xl" } weight:"black"
          "Follow the imports from entrypoint to UI"
        Text color:"muted"
          "These five files form one complete route. Each file has one clear responsibility, and every reference is resolved before Dowe generates a target."
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:2 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:3
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"primary"
              "main.dowe"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Activates the imported route graph."
            Code:
              language:"dowe"
              variant:"soft"
              scheme:"surface"
              copyLabel:"Copy main.dowe"
              copiedLabel:"Copied"
              content:"""
                import AppRoutes from "@/views/routes/app-routes"

                main
                  views:AppRoutes
              """
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:3
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "views/routes/app-routes.dowe"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Maps the root path to AppLayout and HomePage."
            Code:
              language:"dowe"
              variant:"soft"
              scheme:"surface"
              copyLabel:"Copy route graph"
              copiedLabel:"Copied"
              content:"""
                import AppLayout from "@/views/layouts/app-layout"
                import HomePage from "@/views/pages/home-page"

                views AppRoutes
                  group path:"/" layout:AppLayout
                    route path:"" page:HomePage
              """
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:3
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "views/layouts/app-layout.dowe"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Renders shared chrome and places the selected page at children."
            Code:
              language:"dowe"
              variant:"soft"
              scheme:"surface"
              copyLabel:"Copy layout"
              copiedLabel:"Copied"
              content:"""
                import AppBrand from "@/views/components/app-brand"

                layout AppLayout
                  Scaffold
                    appBar
                      AppBar
                        start
                          AppBrand
                    main
                      children
              """
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:3
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "views/pages/home-page.dowe"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Defines only the content for the root route."
            Code:
              language:"dowe"
              variant:"soft"
              scheme:"surface"
              copyLabel:"Copy page"
              copiedLabel:"Copied"
              content:"""
                page HomePage
                  Section
                    Grid columns:1 gap:3
                      Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
                        "Build one system"
                      Text color:"muted"
                        "Dowe generates every selected target from this source."
              """
      Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
        Grid columns:1 gap:3
          Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
            "views/components/app-brand.dowe"
          Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
            "Exports one reusable static tree used by the layout."
          Code:
            language:"dowe"
            variant:"soft"
            scheme:"surface"
            copyLabel:"Copy component"
            copiedLabel:"Copied"
            content:"""
              component AppBrand
                Flex align:"center" gap:2
                  Icon name:"stars-minimalistic"
                  Title size:"md" weight:"bold"
                    "Dowe"
            """
  Section id:"views-route-resolution" p:{ xs:5 md:7 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "ROUTE RESOLUTION"
        Title size:{ xs:"2xl" md:"4xl" } weight:"black"
          "The graph decides the URL"
        Text color:"muted"
          "Page file names do not create routes. Dowe combines each group path with its direct route path and validates the result across every active views graph."
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:3 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"primary"
              "ROOT PAGE"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "/ + empty = /"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "group path:\"/\" with route path:\"\" selects the page at the root URL."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "CHILD PAGE"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "/docs + api = /docs/api"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "A relative route path is appended to its group's path. Groups contain direct routes and cannot contain other groups."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "DUPLICATE"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "One path per target"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Two routes cannot claim the same resolved path for an overlapping platform set. Dowe reports the conflict before generation."
  Section id:"views-decision-guide" py:{ xs:7 md:10 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "DECISION GUIDE"
        Title size:{ xs:"2xl" md:"4xl" } weight:"black"
          "Create the file that owns the change"
        Text color:"muted"
          "Split by responsibility, not by file size alone. A module should answer one architectural question."
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:2 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "A new URL"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Create a page, import it into a views graph, and add one route. The page path and file name do not define the URL."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Shared application chrome"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Create or reuse a layout when multiple routes share navigation, bars, side content, overlays, or another persistent shell."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Repeated static UI"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Create a component when the same static view tree appears in two or more places. Keep state and workflows in the owning page or layout."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "A large route catalog"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Create another focused views graph and connect both from main.dowe with an ordered views list. Routes may navigate across active graphs."
